{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/Fireside_Feelings_Steam_GIF_1e.gif?t=1749312778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fireside Feelings is a mental wellness experience that promotes empathy, connection, and positivity among players. So grab a blanket, your favourite hoody, and a nice beverage and come chat around the campfire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/Fireside_Feelings_Steam_GIF_2e.gif?t=1749312778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cDo your childhood dreams still echo in who you\u2019ve become?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201cDo you prefer to cook food, or have someone cook food for you?\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share your thoughts on a range of topics - sometimes sweet, sometimes profound - to help create a rich and meaningful tapestry of thoughts and feelings that are personal and authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/Fireside_Feelings_Steam_GIF_3e.gif?t=1749312778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock objects to furnish your campfire, and make it your place to stop and take a breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/Fireside_Feelings_Steam_GIF_4e.gif?t=1749312778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share experiences, express your emotions, and be a part of a caring community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conversations are not live, and there is no direct interaction with others. Discover their thoughts at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Answers are moderated and filtered to ensure your safety. Content warnings can be set according to your preferences so certain topics are avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/Fireside_Feelings_Steam_GIF_5e.gif?t=1749312778\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Let the great trees inspire me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/c86353aefe7b748a56ea5012f8e7a70e8aca39df.jpg"},{"name":"Listen to the waves and the passersby","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/69bdc5d2d26cf6c6c898f113edd575eea7fb114d.jpg"},{"name":"Reimagine the world by the fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/0562d3d2c321eca437306df9e3c22f815cded37f.jpg"},{"name":"Find intimacy in parallel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/dfcd6d18f7b7080a10aa9caccb7bc863f1fb75b2.jpg"},{"name":"Make the best soups in the oldest pots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/7f11496bc9ce1bb5bab6caf6acc36525eff4722c.jpg"},{"name":"Fall back into childhood for the length of a show","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/9a4d641e6a7999d70ef3c0af00396e74f76eef9c.jpg"},{"name":"Hear ourself even when we're too far away","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/8326981169712ce7a54210a50379ff456eb30ce1.jpg"},{"name":"Move out of my apartment","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/5e84c57e6823fc0b71892b3ccff3929db2f1851d.jpg"},{"name":"Celebrate those who help me stand tall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/806d754a5fb3c8d0f5baaafc2dbaac682c76ee05.jpg"},{"name":"Talk about money without fear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2990600/3127db3bdb6387092fc4443da5921aac8436fa84.jpg"}],"t