1749312778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock objects to furnish your campfire, and make it your place to stop and take a breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/Fireside_Feelings_Steam_GIF_4e.gif?t=1749312778\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Share experiences, express your emotions, and be a part of a caring community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conversations are not live, and there is no direct interaction with others. Discover their thoughts at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Answers are moderated and filtered to ensure your safety. Content warnings can be set according to your preferences so certain topics are avoided.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/extras/Fireside_Feelings_Steam_GIF_5e.gif?t=1749312778\" /></p>","developers":["Team Empreintes"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990600/60de83ea5f6c7e32f4461984c3b7335615fe158f/header.jpg?t=1749312778","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphic Card handling OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Graphic Card handling OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</s